      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "No 12 is a high-end rental offering superior comfort, premium finishes, and exclusive building amenities that go far beyond standard developments. Located in The Barrington on the 2nd floor this is a luxury unfurnished spacious 2 double bedroom apt. The premier bedroom is ensuite with a walk in shower and bath, good sized walk in wardrobe. The spacious balcony overlooks the sunny forecourt and is accessible from the bedrooms. There is a second bathroom off the entrance hall. Spacious utility room with washing machine & separate dryer. There is a very generous sized living space with folding doors to a winter garden 🪴sunny aspect, ideal for reading the newspaper or wfh space. Fully fitted modern white kitchen with no extras I.e cutlery or plates. There is one parking space and lock up for storage. Ballsbridge is a Prime Location: Situated in central business districts, vibrant cultural hubs, or scenic areas close to fine dining and high-end shopping. Viewing is very highly recommended by the sole agents Sherry FitzGerald Lettings"
      },
